    me:"Nuestra Filosofía",mt:"El crecimiento personal es el proyecto más importante de tu vida.",
    mx:"Jog-A existe para darte las herramientas que antes solo tenían las grandes empresas. Ahora son tuyas.",
    mc:"COMENZAR AHORA",fc:"© 2025 Jog-A Universe · Todos los derechos reservados",
    bl:"EN VIVO",cm:"Próximamente",cd:"Más herramientas del universo Jog-A llegando pronto."},
  en:{np:"Apps",na:"Philosophy",he:"Welcome to the Universe",hw:"Universe",
    hd:"A personal growth platform powered by artificial intelligence. 10 tools. One universe.",
    ce:"EXPLORE APPS",ca:"LEARN MORE",sa:"APPLICATIONS",sl:"LIVE NOW",sp:"POTENTIAL",
    pe:"The Complete Ecosystem",ph1:"10 Worlds.",ph2:"One Vision.",
    ps:"Each tool is its own universe. Together, they form something greater than any of them alone.",
    me:"Our Philosophy",mt:"Personal growth is the most important project of your life.",
